===Noun===
'''κλέος''' (kleos) 

# [[renown|Renown]]; [[honor]]. It is related to the word "to [[hear]]" and carries the implied meaning of "what others hear about you". A Greek [[hero]] earns ''κλέος'' through accomplishing great deeds, often through battle. 

